( https://albiononline.com/news/into-the-fray-patch-6 )

Adventurer,

Into the Fray Patch 6 is live, introducing *Japanese* and *Italian* to Albi=
on Online! The game is now fully playable in both of these languages, and t=
here are also dedicated in-game chat channels and new language-specific sub=
forums.

All articles and patchnotes will now be translated into these languages to =
keep you fully updated, and if you wish to change the language in which you=
 receive our newsletters you can update this in your *Account Settings* ( h=
ttps://albiononline.com/profile/ ).

We hope to make playing Albion Online a more immersive and user-friendly ex=
perience for our existing Japanese and Italian-speaking players. And to tho=
se who are joining the game for the first time now: *welcome* !

( https://albiononline.com/news/s17-starts-saturday )

Season 17 is Coming
-------------------

Into the Fray Patch 6 includes some more big developments, such as a brand-=
new *Guild Finder*. And with Season 17 starting *September 17* ( https://al=
biononline.com/news/s17-starts-saturday ) , it also brings some important d=
evelopments to Guild Season gameplay, with changes to the *Crystal Arena* ,=
 *Headquarters Hideouts* , *Treasure Chests* , *Corrupted Dungeons* and mor=
e. For more on the Season 17 changes and rewards, *click here* ( https://al=
biononline.com/en/news/s17-starts-saturday ).

( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2022 )

Take the Heretic Challenge
--------------------------

Fall has reached Albion, and the *Heretic Challenge* is upon us! Until the =
end of September you can earn points for open-world activities, unlock ches=
ts to get valuable loot, and claim your very own *Heretic Combat Mule*. Rea=
d more here:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2022 )

